WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.510 --> 00:00:02.350
- What am I going as for Halloween?

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.850
A nerd!

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:05.470
Don't ask surprised.

00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:07.890
Pocahontas, if you've paid
even a little attention

00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:09.200
to the political world lately,

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.050
you know that's President Donald Trump's

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:12.900
preferred nickname for Elizabeth Warren,

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:15.480
the democratic senator from Massachusetts.

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:17.170
It's an admittedly crude reference

00:00:17.170 --> 00:00:19.770
to her claim that she is
of Native American descent

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:22.580
and Trump's somewhat fact-free response

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:24.910
that Warren claimed her
status as a minority

00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:28.690
to get ahead in the world of academia.

00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:31.140
So why does any of this matter you ask.

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:33.500
Well, because Warren is running.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:35.448
Mmm, should I say, considering running

00:00:35.448 --> 00:00:37.970
for president in 2020 against,

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:40.380
you guessed it, Donald John Trump.

00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:43.260
Which brings us to what
Warren did recently,

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:46.490
out of the blue, she released
a five plus minute video

00:00:46.490 --> 00:00:49.020
in which she travels back to her hometown,

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:50.350
that's Norman Oklahoma,

00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:54.100
to extensively trace her family tree.

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:56.780
The video is slickly produced
and has all the hallmarks

00:00:56.780 --> 00:00:58.680
of a video someone running for president,

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:00.681
or considering running for president.

00:01:00.681 --> 00:01:02.160
(bell dings)
Would make.

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:03.620
There's the folksy conversation

00:01:03.620 --> 00:01:04.900
with Warren's extended family

00:01:04.900 --> 00:01:06.350
about their hearth's gravel roots.

00:01:06.350 --> 00:01:08.450
The shots of Warren doing
normal people stuff,

00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:11.790
you know, like walking
and pointing at things

00:01:11.790 --> 00:01:14.350
and repeated mentions
of how Warren's mother

00:01:14.350 --> 00:01:16.030
always told her family that she was

00:01:16.030 --> 00:01:17.890
of Native American heritage.

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:20.510
And then comes the big reveal.

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:23.480
Warren, on the phone with
renowned Stanford geneticist,

00:01:23.480 --> 00:01:26.290
Carlos Bustamante, he's
an advisor to 23andMe,

00:01:26.290 --> 00:01:29.270
we've all heard of that,
asked whether Trump is right,

00:01:29.270 --> 00:01:31.530
or her mother is right
and if she does in fact

00:01:31.530 --> 00:01:33.760
have Native American ancestry.

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:35.250
Bustamante responds that.

00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:36.753
- The facts suggest that you absoulutely

00:01:36.753 --> 00:01:39.920
have a Native American
ancestor in your pedigree.

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:43.150
- Which, if you ask me is
not exactly definitive.

00:01:43.150 --> 00:01:45.690
Think of it this way, if I go
to the doctor for a physical

00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:47.940
and at the end, when I
ask them if I'm healthy,

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:50.420
he says, quote, the facts suggest

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:52.620
that you absolutely are healthy,

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:55.300
I'm feeling good, but I'm
not feeling great, right?

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:57.600
I'd rather have heard, you
are absolutely healthy!

00:01:57.600 --> 00:02:02.090
You are going to live until
you are 120 years old.

00:02:02.090 --> 00:02:05.750
The word, suggest, from
Bustamante throws a decent slice

00:02:05.750 --> 00:02:07.710
of doubt into the proceedings.

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:09.780
The conclusion from Warren's DNA test.

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:13.380
A test Trump himself has
routinely called on her to take

00:02:13.380 --> 00:02:15.350
doesn't help her case
all that much either.

00:02:15.350 --> 00:02:17.100
She is, according to the best estimate

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:22.100
somewhere between 1/64 an
1/1,024 Native American.

00:02:22.142 --> 00:02:23.830
1/1,024!

00:02:23.830 --> 00:02:27.800
That's 0.0097%, which is not a lot.

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:29.500
Now sidebar on the timing of all of this.

00:02:29.500 --> 00:02:31.620
Warren's people say the
results were released

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:34.240
soon after she got them, which, fine.

00:02:34.240 --> 00:02:36.940
But of course, DNA
tests measure one thing,

00:02:36.940 --> 00:02:39.750
and we know ethnic identity is complex.

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:41.330
That's something that
the Secretary of State

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:43.060
for the Cherokee Nation brought up

00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:45.927
in his response to the
whole thing, saying quote,

00:02:45.927 --> 00:02:48.627
"Using a DNA test to lay
claim to any connection

00:02:48.627 --> 00:02:51.240
"to the Cherokee Nation
or any tribal nation,

00:02:51.240 --> 00:02:53.630
even vaguely, is inappropriate and wrong."

00:02:53.630 --> 00:02:55.616
That's Chuck Hoskin Jr., he added,

00:02:55.616 --> 00:02:58.727
"Senator Warren is
undermining tribal interests

00:02:58.727 --> 00:03:02.278
"with her continued claims
of tribal heritage."

00:03:02.278 --> 00:03:03.111
Ugh.

00:03:03.111 --> 00:03:05.630
All of which leaves me
wondering why did Warren

00:03:05.630 --> 00:03:08.120
do this DNA thing at all?

00:03:08.120 --> 00:03:11.270
Yes, of course, I get
what she was trying to do.

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:13.170
She knew that Trump's Pocahontas attack

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:16.230
was doing her some damage
among skiddish democrats

00:03:16.230 --> 00:03:18.910
who don't wanna nominate someone in 2020

00:03:18.910 --> 00:03:20.930
who has a gaping weakness that Trump,

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:22.890
the biggest bully on the block,

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:25.040
would and could exploit.

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:26.910
Warren wanted to show that she couldn't

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:28.760
and wouldn't be swift-boated.

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:30.480
What do I mean by that term?

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:33.690
Democrats are still bitter
about the 2004 campaign

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:35.320
in which a number of men who had served

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:36.940
with Massachusetts Senator, John Kerry,

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:38.860
on swift-boats in Vietnam claimed

00:03:38.860 --> 00:03:41.790
that he had badly exaggerated
his acts of bravery

00:03:41.790 --> 00:03:42.980
during the war.

00:03:42.980 --> 00:03:45.120
Kerry was caught flat-footed by an attack

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:47.750
on what most people believe
was his greatest strength,

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:51.320
his military service in Vietnam
and really never recovered,

00:03:51.320 --> 00:03:53.480
losing to George W. Bush.

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:56.320
So Warren wanted to tell
democrats that she was ready

00:03:56.320 --> 00:04:01.310
for Trump's attacks and had
the facts 100% on her side.

00:04:01.310 --> 00:04:04.210
That he would come at her,
but she would punch back hard

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:05.370
and effectively.

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:07.650
She wanted to reassure them
that there was no danger

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:10.660
that in nominating her, they
could be risking their chances

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:12.900
of beating Trump, their last chance

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:14.850
at beating Trump in 2020.

00:04:14.850 --> 00:04:17.170
Sidebar, democrats are also still haunted

00:04:17.170 --> 00:04:19.890
by Hilary Clinton's loss to Trump in 2016.

00:04:19.890 --> 00:04:21.740
A defeat they lay, at least in part,

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:23.624
at the feet of the fact
that she simply had

00:04:23.624 --> 00:04:26.600
too much baggage from
past political fights

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:29.530
that he could and did exploit effectively.

00:04:29.530 --> 00:04:32.780
All the while amazingly
side-stepping the baggage

00:04:32.780 --> 00:04:33.890
he had of his own.

00:04:33.890 --> 00:04:36.900
The problem here is that
Warren's video and DNA test

00:04:36.900 --> 00:04:40.610
didn't tie things up in a
nice bow for her or democrats.

00:04:40.610 --> 00:04:42.620
Even the most favorable reading

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:44.550
of what Warren's DNA test showed

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:46.530
is that there's a high probability

00:04:46.530 --> 00:04:50.110
that she has a tiny bit of
Native American blood in her.

00:04:50.110 --> 00:04:53.030
Now, that fact doesn't change this fact.

00:04:53.030 --> 00:04:56.050
That when the story first
broke, way back in 2012,

00:04:56.050 --> 00:04:58.440
Warren initially said she had no idea

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:00.030
that she was not only listed,

00:05:00.030 --> 00:05:03.020
but touted as a minority
by Harvard Law School.

00:05:03.020 --> 00:05:05.240
She then had to acknowledge
that she had listed

00:05:05.240 --> 00:05:08.440
her minority status on some federal forms.

00:05:08.440 --> 00:05:11.450
Another sidebar, Harvard and
the University of Pennsylvania

00:05:11.450 --> 00:05:13.670
continue to say that her ancestry

00:05:13.670 --> 00:05:16.100
was not a factor in her hiring.

00:05:16.100 --> 00:05:18.900
Now the DNA test doesn't offer any sort

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:22.720
of conclusive, beyond a
shadow of a doubt, evidence

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:24.450
of Warren's Native American heritage,

00:05:24.450 --> 00:05:26.970
and therefore it remains
today what it's been

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:27.950
for the past six years.

00:05:27.950 --> 00:05:30.880
It's an effective attack line
for her political opponents,

00:05:30.880 --> 00:05:33.360
democrats and republicans.

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:35.290
Enter Trump.

00:05:35.290 --> 00:05:38.117
He tweeted, quote,
"Pocahontas, the bad version,

00:05:38.117 --> 00:05:39.837
"sometimes referred to as Elizabeth Warren

00:05:39.837 --> 00:05:41.687
"is getting slammed.

00:05:41.687 --> 00:05:43.887
"She took a bogus DNA test and it showed

00:05:43.887 --> 00:05:46.487
"that she may be 1/1,024,

00:05:46.487 --> 00:05:48.187
"far less than the average American.

00:05:48.187 --> 00:05:49.747
"Now Cherokee Nation denies her.

00:05:49.747 --> 00:05:51.127
"DNA test is useless.

00:05:51.127 --> 00:05:52.287
"Even they don't want her.

00:05:52.287 --> 00:05:53.560
"Phony!"

00:05:53.560 --> 00:05:55.697
Then he tweeted again.

00:05:55.697 --> 00:05:58.237
"Elizabeth Warren is being
hammered, even by the left.

00:05:58.237 --> 00:06:00.030
"Her false claim of Indian heritage

00:06:00.030 --> 00:06:04.460
is only selling to very
low IQ individuals."

00:06:04.460 --> 00:06:07.220
This is of course what Trump does.

00:06:07.220 --> 00:06:09.410
He boasts, he brags, he bullies.

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:11.740
But Warren's DNA test reveal was aimed

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:15.290
at taking potent arrow out
of Donald Trump's quiver.

00:06:15.290 --> 00:06:19.690
Instead, she gave him
lots more ammunition.

00:06:19.690 --> 00:06:22.260
And that is ThePo!nt.

00:06:22.260 --> 00:06:24.260
We do this every week, twice.

00:06:24.260 --> 00:06:26.470
Check back every Tuesday and Thursday

00:06:26.470 --> 00:06:28.616
for brand new episodes.

00:06:28.616 --> 00:06:31.033
(jazz music)

